  "question": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/aa8dbad6-61f8-4c5b-8d89-48e3e1073531-image.png\" style=\"width: 350px; height: 189px;\" /></p><p>As per the given graph, choose the correct representation for curve <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> and curve <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math><br />{Where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>C</mi></msub><mo>=</mo></math> Reactance of pure capacitive circuit connected with A.C. source<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>L</mi></msub><mo>=</mo></math> Reactance of pure inductive circuit connected with A.C. source<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo></math> Impedance of pure resistive circuit connected with A.C. source<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Z</mi><mo>=</mo></math> Impedance of the <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>L</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>R</mi></math> series circuit }</p>",
    "image": null
  },
